# This repo has core.autocrlf=true, so a checkout rewrites text files to CRLF.
# For a hook that is a silent failure waiting to happen: "#!/bin/sh\r" is a
# "bad interpreter" error on Linux and macOS, and a hook that does not run is
# fail-open — exactly what a guard must never be. Pin it to LF.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf

# Never normalize binary assets. (They should not be committed at all — see
# .gitignore — but the two installers uploaded on 2026-08-31 are already here.)
*.exe binary
*.apk binary
*.msi binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
